  'Loop': '回路', 'Connected lines': '已连接管线', 'not placed on a sheet': '尚未放置在图纸上', 'no other instrument shares this loop': '没有其他仪表共用此回路', 'untagged — no loop': '未标注 — 无回路', 'nothing connected yet': '尚未连接任何内容', 'not on an operator screen': '不在操作员画面上', 'Passwords need at least {count} characters.': '密码至少需要 {count} 个字符。', 'Enter your email address first, then choose Forgot password.': '请先输入邮箱地址，再选择“忘记密码”。', 'Reset link sent. Check your inbox, and the spam folder.': '重置链接已发送，请检查收件箱和垃圾邮件文件夹。', 'Commercial use requires a paid licence.': '商业用途需要付费许可。', 'Reload to get the latest version? Your unsaved changes are autosaved, but any edit from the last moment may be lost.': '重新加载以获取最新版本？未保存的修改已自动保存，但刚才的最后编辑可能丢失。', 'IPD Studio is under active development, so new versions ship often. You are prompted when one is ready; use this to check right now and reload.': 'IPD Studio 正在持续开发，新版本会频繁发布。版本就绪时会提示你；也可以现在检查并重新加载。', 'refreshing…': '正在刷新…', 'updates often': '频繁更新', 'In active development': '正在持续开发', 'New versions ship often. If something looks out of date, reload the page': '新版本会频繁发布。如发现内容过期，请重新加载页面', 'Get the latest': '获取最新版本',
