  'Could not save to your account.': '无法保存到你的账号。', 'Legacy JSON drawing': '旧版 JSON 图纸', 'This drawing is': '此图纸大小为', 'over the': '，超过', 'limit for a cloud drawing.': '的云端图纸大小限制。', 'A DXF underlay is almost always the reason — it carries every traced polyline of the original CAD file.': '几乎总是 DXF 底图导致 — 它携带了原 CAD 文件的每条描摹多段线。', 'Remove the underlay from its sheet and save again, or keep this one as a .pnid file on your computer.': '请从图纸移除底图后重新保存，或将该图纸作为 .pnid 文件保存在本机。',
